    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spaceflux 1.0 is launching on June 11 for $4.99!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SPACEFLUX\u00a0</strong>- THE ONE &amp; ONLY<strong> FRACTAL FPS! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>fractal space</strong>, the map contains itself. Going to the center takes you back to where you started. You can never reach the center!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/652ebec9e9c127159c99c0683b900450.poster.avif?t=1749650676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/652ebec9e9c127159c99c0683b900450.webm?t=1749650676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/652ebec9e9c127159c99c0683b900450.mp4?t=1749650676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RECURSIVE ARENA COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn to navigate the fractals in hyper-fast PvP combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>infinite</strong> copies of the map, with a copy of <i>you</i> on each map. Be careful, don't shoot yourself in the back!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your opponents have copies too. Shoot any copy to kill them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/c1d118925d9ce196d79ee5267c91330c.poster.avif?t=1749650676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/c1d118925d9ce196d79ee5267c91330c.webm?t=1749650676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/c1d118925d9ce196d79ee5267c91330c.mp4?t=1749650676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MORE IMPOSSIBLE SPACES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fractal space is just 1 of the 6 impossible spaces:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horizontal Loop\u00a0</strong>- the map repeats infinitely in all directions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimap\u00a0</strong>- a mini-version of the map exists within the map. Jump inside to land back onto the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mirror Mode -</strong>\u00a0the map is reflected and so are you\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Portals\u00a0</strong>- enter a portal to another place in the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vertical Loop</strong> - fall forever!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/vloop.gif?t=1749650676\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HORDE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The single player roguelike<strong>\u00a0</strong>where you fight endless waves of heads in all impossible spaces. Can you beat <strong>Atomic Pete</strong>, or will he erase you from existence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/7b338b4ae1d9c14e7763187dd6aca0cc.poster.avif?t=1749650676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/7b338b4ae1d9c14e7763187dd6aca0cc.webm?t=1749650676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/7b338b4ae1d9c14e7763187dd6aca0cc.mp4?t=1749650676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2-4 Player multiplayer deathmatches</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Fully destructible and impossible maps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player survival horde mode</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn on \u2018Psychedelic Mode\u2019 to mess with your friends</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abilities to flip gravity, spawn decoys or disguise yourself as a box</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cosmetic gun skins for all 10 weapons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller &amp; Steam Deck support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Peer-to-peer matchmaking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you so much for your patience and support over the last 4 years of Early Access!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Calin</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spaceflux 1.0 is launching on June 11 for $4.99!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SPACEFLUX\u00a0</strong>- THE ONE &amp; ONLY<strong> FRACTAL FPS! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>fractal space</strong>, the map contains itself. Going to the center takes you back to where you started. You can never reach the center!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/652ebec9e9c127159c99c0683b900450.poster.avif?t=1749650676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/652ebec9e9c127159c99c0683b900450.webm?t=1749650676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/652ebec9e9c127159c99c0683b900450.mp4?t=1749650676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RECURSIVE ARENA COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn to navigate the fractals in hyper-fast PvP combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>infinite</strong> copies of the map, with a copy of <i>you</i> on each map. Be careful, don't shoot yourself in the back!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your opponents have copies too. Shoot any copy to kill them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/c1d118925d9ce196d79ee5267c91330c.poster.avif?t=1749650676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/c1d118925d9ce196d79ee5267c91330c.webm?t=1749650676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/c1d118925d9ce196d79ee5267c91330c.mp4?t=1749650676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MORE IMPOSSIBLE SPACES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fractal space is just 1 of the 6 impossible spaces:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horizontal Loop\u00a0</strong>- the map repeats infinitely in all directions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimap\u00a0</strong>- a mini-version of the map exists within the map. Jump inside to land back onto the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mirror Mode -</strong>\u00a0the map is reflected and so are you\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Portals\u00a0</strong>- enter a portal to another place in the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vertical Loop</strong> - fall forever!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/vloop.gif?t=1749650676\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HORDE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The single player roguelike<strong>\u00a0</strong>where you fight endless waves of heads in all impossible spaces. Can you beat <strong>Atomic Pete</strong>, or will he erase you from existence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/7b338b4ae1d9c14e7763187dd6aca0cc.poster.avif?t=1749650676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/7b338b4ae1d9c14e7763187dd6aca0cc.webm?t=1749650676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1344440/extras/7b338b4ae1d9c14e7763187dd6aca0cc.mp4?t=1749650676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2-4 Player multiplayer deathmatches</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Fully destructible and impossible maps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player survival horde mode</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn on \u2018Psychedelic Mode\u2019 to mess with your friends</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abilities to flip gravity, spawn decoys or disguise yourself as a box</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cosmetic gun skins for all 10 weapons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller &amp; Steam Deck support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Peer-to-peer matchmaking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you so much for your patience and support over the last 4 years of Early Access!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Calin</h2>",
    "short_description": "An FPS arena shooter with mind-bending fractal maps! Fight in an impossible battle arena where the map contains itself in a never-ending loop. With online/splitscreen multiplayer deathmatches and a single player horde mode. 1.0 LAUNCHING ON JUNE 11 FOR $4.99!",
